  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [44, 18, 880, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Gated MLA：NoPE 全局注意力 + 全秩输出门
  # ===== 分析结论 =====
  - elementId: concl-label-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [44, 58, 88, 110]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: concl-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [44, 58, 88, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>分析</p>
        <p>结论</p>
  - elementId: concl-body-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [140, 58, 784, 110]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#F2F2F2"}
  - elementId: concl-bullets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [154, 63, 756, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li><strong>结构定位</strong>：三步计算——下投影 \(c_t=W_c x_t\) 缓存低维隐向量，注意力时 \(k_t,v_t=W_{k,v} c_t\) 重建（decode 吸收上投影直接以 \(c_t\) 计算），输出门 \(y=W_o[\sigma(W_g x)\odot\tilde{o}]\)；24+1 层承担全局交互 → 缓存规模降一个量级</li>
        <li style="margin-top:4px"><strong>改动① 全面 NoPE</strong>：位置建模完全交给 KDA 递归层 → 上下文外推不受 RoPE 限制，单 token 缓存进一步减小</li>
        <li style="margin-top:4px"><strong>改动② 全秩输出门</strong>：与 KDA 同款门控，逐通道调节全局注意力读出 → 新增一次标准稠密 GEMM，CUBE 友好</li>
        <li style="margin-top:4px"><strong>训练数值</strong>：注意力输出保持 FP32 修正舍入偏差 → 以片上 buffer 重排换精度与吞吐兼得</li>
        </ul>

  # ===== 左：模块结构 =====
  - elementId: arch-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [44, 180, 200, 15]
    content:
      style: "$sectitle"
